{"manifest":"{\"format\":1,\"version\":\"5.0.8\",\"notes\":\"5.0.8 — Kovan beta 0.1.3: League Asistanı'na eşya önerisi eklendi. Canlı maçta ve şampiyon seçiminde rakip takımın hasar dağılımına göre zırh, büyü direnci, yara azaltma, delme ve ayakkabı önerileri gösterilir (Riot Data Dragon eşya verisinden kaba kurallarla; gerçek kazanma oranı değildir). Windows'ta ve gerçek League istemcisiyle denenmedi.\",\"minLoader\":1,\"created\":\"2026-11-06T09:24:10.486Z\",\"files\":{\"StatScan.html\":{\"sha256\":\"cd9b833528cbbfd5ebc2983a66083a37413101f6fc724b3e1cb5a41db6db28b0\",\"size\":1404370},\"desktop/app.js\":{\"sha256\":\"53dbdbb7ea410ef4efc8bdd6f6ba3f5343ef85708771128b48afb74756468c51\",\"size\":12999},\"desktop/assets/icon.ico\":{\"sha256\":\"b0d623d0b828bcf7603ee02ac7b5cc8e9b27b13fdb5c3eff548f2cb7b7963543\",\"size\":372526},\"desktop/assets/icon.png\":{\"sha256\":\"6ce7c330fdcf2d8785ba7ea16895cc376bfbb22b4ee061da7a0692002c3ca376\",\"size\":99730},\"desktop/host.js\":{\"sha256\":\"3ccdd8930669164956af41c5587f4395bbb07517c1b940536f2fa19651b2b4fd\",\"size\":315093},\"desktop/preload.js\":{\"sha256\":\"c78d003581df35b82c4805da86ab0f842e76db869df60691aabaaf85f552fc7f\",\"size\":8262},\"dyn/collector.ps1\":{\"sha256\":\"3329b8cdf5257002b1f0fbe10bbc0da8ed09103d33ff67618ab8d897a61b71cb\",\"size\":39356},\"dyn/README-dinamik.md\":{\"sha256\":\"da91e62f58ce365cdec59c1ec4b689c8cf0412e742c1ea728d8ba09394485b0d\",\"size\":7201},\"dyn/statscan-dyn.js\":{\"sha256\":\"bfc3f746e061f22ae93f36968e0952f2162470b39534a2d3f8c6489795b0f883\",\"size\":115235}}}","sig":"lGxtxrbyYRwGYJho+FK7EEx74rlPk98Ode/5dk/FgCGYtZTeumtgUQz1+YZvrx9t6TCr1apJUHB3NRD2dv3PBA==","data":{"StatScan.html":"","desktop/app.js":"","desktop/assets/icon.ico":"","desktop/assets/icon.png":"","desktop/host.js":"","desktop/preload.js":"","dyn/collector.ps1":"","dyn/README-dinamik.md":"","dyn/statscan-dyn.js":""}}